  {
    "id": 2001009010060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "温かいうちに一緒に食べませんかっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200100901/2001009010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、焼き芋かぁ\r\nさっきの連絡はこのためだったんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009010070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\n事務所に来る途中で屋台を見つけて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100901/2001009010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009010080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "お芋の甘くていい匂いにつられて、\r\n買っちゃいましたっ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100901/2001009010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうか。わざわざ俺の分までありがとう\r\n……せっかくだし、頂こうかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──うん、ほくほくしててすごく美味い！\r\n俺も、屋台のあのメロディーを聞くと無性に食べたくなるよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……焼き芋の季節になったんだなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009010090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ふふっ、そうですね\r\nなんだか、秋なんだなって思って私もつい買っちゃいます",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100901/2001009010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、確かに秋の風物詩って感じだよな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……もう秋か──",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "紅葉が\r\n綺麗な季節だ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "身体を\r\n動かしたくなるな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "天高く\r\n馬肥ゆる……",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009010100,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\nちょうど見ごろの時期ですっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100901/2001009010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もし時間ができれば、\r\n温泉にでも入りながらゆっくり眺めたいもんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009010110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "温泉……ほわぁ……\r\nとってもいいですねっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100901/2001009010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだろう？\r\n落ちてくる紅葉を眺めながら肩まで湯につかったら……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009010120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……想像するだけで\r\nとっても気持ちよくなってきちゃいますっ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100901/2001009010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009010130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ふふ……灯織ちゃんとめぐるちゃん、ふたりとも一緒に\r\nゆっくり見れたら……素敵です……っ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100901/2001009010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうだな\r\nみんながまとまった休みをとれるよう、俺も頑張るよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009010140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "本当ですかっ？\r\nありがとうございますっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100901/2001009010140"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009010150,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ふふっ、そうですねっ\r\n涼しくって、でもなんだかポカポカして……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100901/2001009010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009010160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私も普段より遠くまで歩いたりしちゃいますっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100901/2001009010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "秋はハイキングの季節でもあるもんな\r\n紅葉の見られるコースなんか歩いたらすごそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009010170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ、葉っぱが鮮やかに色付いていて……",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100901/2001009010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009010171,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "とっても綺麗で、すごく気持ちがいいですっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100901/2001009010171"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それはいいな\r\n真乃は、季節の名所みたいなところにも結構行くのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009010180,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "最近は、なかなか機会がないんですけれど\r\n以前はよく行っていましたっ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100901/2001009010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、もし時間が空いたら\r\n他のふたりも誘って行ってみるか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009010190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわぁ……みんなで……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100901/2001009010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009010191,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ、ぜひ行きましょうっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
